  "remarks": "Aleksandr Kalyagin is the Minister of Education and Science of the Zaporizhzhia Oblast region under the Russian occupation administration since April 2025. In that capacity, he has approved and overseen the implementation of programmes of patriotic education in schools that introduce systemic ideological and military-patriotic activities for pupils, including lessons promoting state narratives, activities related to Russian historical memory and state symbols, and participation in youth initiatives with military-patriotic elements. In addition, Aleksandr Kalyagin has signed a cooperation agreement with the All-Russian organisation “Voluntary Society for Assistance to the Army, Aviation and Navy of Russia” (DOSAAF) to implement youth programmes aimed at strengthening patriotic education.",
